                                                "text": "\"I wanted to call her Taylor, but my husband said no,\" Sweetie was telling one of the Christmas party guests.\n\"Taylor means a tailor,\" I said. \"It seems inauspicious. Like calling her Cobbler.\"\n\"That's a kind of drink,\" said Nani."
